FILE: metadata.py
PURPOSE: Generates structured column/table metadata via LLM; stores/retrieves from ChromaDB for RAG.
IMPORTS: json, pandas, session, llm

FUNCTIONS:
  generate_rich_metadata(df, answers=None) -> dict
    LLM-generates column descriptions, types, example values, aliases; optionally enriched by Smart Parser answers.

  generate_schema_summary(metadata) -> dict
    Produces a short dataset description used in SQL prompts.

  generate_smart_parser_questions(df) -> list[dict]
    Returns questions to ask the user about dataset context (Smart Parser mode).

  store_metadata_in_vectordb(metadata, session)
    Chunks metadata docs; upserts into session.metadata_collection (ChromaDB).

  retrieve_relevant_metadata(query, session, top_k=6) -> str
    Queries ChromaDB with query text; returns formatted metadata string for LLM prompt.

  _col_to_doc / _table_to_doc / _format_full_metadata — formatting helpers
